    "body": "Ruby version 3.3.6 does not satisfy the version constraint specified in the Gemfile and gemspec files. The Gemfile (line 3) specifies `ruby \"~> 3.2\"`, which means >= 3.2.0 and < 3.3.0. All gemspec files in tools/ruby-gems/ also specify `required_ruby_version = \"~> 3.2\"`. Ruby 3.3.6 falls outside this range. You should either use a Ruby 3.2.x version (e.g., 3.2.7 if available) or update the version constraints in Gemfile and all gemspec files to accept Ruby 3.3.x.\n```suggestion\nruby = \"3.2.7\"\n```",
